_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Indeed. However, it's currently difficult to implement before the first scan.\r\n\r\nI'm going to make the `EditorFileSystem` and `UID` cache files more reliable and rely on those for checks.\r\n\r\nFirst, build the file system tree based on the cache files. Then, check for file changes using the scan_changes logic.\r\n\r\nThere are some commits currently, but they're not complete yet: https://github.com/Rindbee/godot/tree/make-editor-file-system-more-reliable\r\n\r\nThis way of checking validity may eventually be deprecated.","created_at":"2025-09-14T13:44:38Z","updated_at":"2025-09-14T13:46:50Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110446#discussion_r2347338769","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110446","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2347338769"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110446#discussion_r2347338769"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110446"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengin